classDiagram
  class CanonicalManifest {
    +projectName raya
    +leadId raya
    +leadBackend.backendId codex-app-server
    +projectDir ~/Dev/raya-lead-workspace
    register 产生, 只是 projects.json 的投影
  }
  class MigrationLedger {
    +migration_id
    +checkpoint P2..P7
    +target_raya_sha 9d63a2b2
    +authorization 五 token 授权行
    +legacy_owner[] 两个旧 job 的停机记录
    +window_probe / cutover_probe
    +cursor path+seed_input+sha256
    +baseline quiet15m
    +unresolved[] / resolutions[]
    +flywheel_rebinds[]
  }
  class SeedInput {
    +migrationId
    +expectedBeforeSha256 null
    +writerStopped true
    +channels[channelId, lastConfirmedMessageId]
  }
  class InboundCursor {
    +channelId -> lastConfirmedMessageId
    新 Lead 从这里往后收信
  }
  class Proof {
    +lead pid/start/activation_id/thread_id/tui
    +business source_sha/artifact/persona
    +checks preflight/pump/text/summary/alert
    +cutover seed/window ids/unresolved_count 0
  }
  class DeployReceiptV2 {
    +schemaVersion 2
    +carrier standard-lead
    +outcome deployed
    +deployed_sha (Raya)
    +flywheel_deployed_sha
    +lead/business/checks/cutover
    +rollback_target null(首次)
  }
  CanonicalManifest --> MigrationLedger : 班车 host_capable 后读账本
  MigrationLedger --> SeedInput : P3 写
  SeedInput --> InboundCursor : seed 工具写
  MigrationLedger --> Proof : H4 工具读账本取证
  Proof --> DeployReceiptV2 : 班车 N+1 P6 校验后写
